From: songliyong <songliyong@contributor>


Date: Wed, 17 Sep 2025 20:52:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] BUGFIX fix kill wrong thrd bug

Issue:
------
two session may share the same thrd, kill session1, but
session2 may be killed if session2 is runing.

Solution:
---------
skip setting interrupt flag if thd is not running.
---
 plugin/threadpool/tests/mtr/suite.opt         |   1 +
 .../tests/mtr/threadpool_killquery.opt        |   3 +
 .../tests/mtr/threadpool_killquery.result     |  56 ++++++++
 .../tests/mtr/threadpool_killquery.test       | 134 ++++++++++++++++++
 plugin/threadpool/threadpool_unix.cc          |  10 +-
 sql/sql_class.cc                              |   1 +
 sql/sql_class.h                               |  25 ++++
 storage/dstore/handler/ha_cde.cc              |   5 +-
 8 files changed, 230 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 plugin/threadpool/tests/mtr/threadpool_killquery.opt
 create mode 100644 plugin/threadpool/tests/mtr/threadpool_killquery.result
 create mode 100644 plugin/threadpool/tests/mtr/threadpool_killquery.test

